def replace1(s,old,new):assert s.count(old)==1,('Replacement count',old[:100],s.count(old));return s.replace(old,new,1)
EXTRACTION='Official Japanese e-Gov source JSON is reproduced as structured text only. Table, ArithFormula and Fig subtrees are excluded at their original locations; each outermost exclusion has a separately labelled portal notice and official-source link. Titles, related-article references and Remarks outside those excluded subtrees are retained. All remaining source text leaves and their order, source-node relationships and attributes are preserved. SupplProvision AmendLawNum/Extract/Type and MainProvision Extract flags are displayed as explicit source-attribute annotations. OldNum/Num and empty ParagraphNum labels are disclosed as metadata rather than invented statutory numbering. Ruby readings and emphasis dots remain associated with their original base characters. Portal annotations are not statutory wording. Text SHA-256 covers only the concatenated retained source text leaves, excluding portal notices; the original source SHA-256 is unchanged. This is a partial, unofficial text reproduction, not a complete-law or current-force certification. Official-source main-provision excerpt flags remain limitations of the source itself. Original vertical typography is not reproduced.'
SCOPE='Partial, unofficial original-language text reproduction; no translation. Tables, formulas and figures are outside this portal’s text-only scope and are explicitly marked at their original locations. Source-provided main-provision excerpts remain excerpts. Only this source snapshot is represented, not all legislation or a certified complete/current act. Check the official source for legal force, current amendments and omitted content. Images and PDF files are not reproduced.'
NOTICE='일본 법령은 텍스트 전용 부분 재현입니다. 표·수식·그림은 위치별 제외 안내와 공식 원문 링크를 제공하며, 나머지 법문과 부칙·발췌·역사적 항 번호·루비 구조를 복원했습니다. 구조 검토 표시는 유지합니다. 공식 원문의 전체 내용·효력·판본을 확인하세요. Japanese law is reproduced as partial structured text. Tables, formulas and figures are omitted with notices; other source text and metadata are restored. Structural review remains open. Consult the official source for complete content, legal force and edition.'
SUPPL='Restored source metadata: exact supplementary-provision AmendLawNum, Extract and Type attributes are displayed beside their provisions as labelled portal annotations, not statutory wording.'
TABLE='Omitted tables: all table subtrees, including merged cells, are excluded from this portal’s text-only reproduction. Each outermost omission is marked with its source position and official-source link. Non-table titles, related-article references and Remarks are retained.'
RUBY='Restored ruby structure: retained source readings and emphasis marks remain associated with their base characters using native ruby markup. Original typography and vertical layout are not certified.'
FINAL='Source attributes and portal omission notices are not statutory wording. Original vertical typography is not reproduced.'
EXCERPT='Official-source limitation: e-Gov marks the main provision as an excerpt (MainProvision Extract=true). This snapshot is not the complete main provision, even if all available source text is reproduced.'
OLDNUM='Restored historic-numbering metadata: exact OldNum, Num and original ParagraphNum values, including empty labels, are displayed as portal annotations. No statutory paragraph number is invented.'
FIG='Omitted figure: the source Fig node and its image remain outside this portal’s text-only scope. Its original location, source identifier and official-source link are displayed; the image is not reproduced.'
FORMULA='Omitted formula/reference nodes: outermost ArithFormula subtrees are excluded with source-location notices and official-source links. Formula nodes inside excluded tables are covered by the enclosing table notice.'
